    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of policy and regulatory analysis for agricultural insurance assessed - Assessment Reports</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator measures the number of public policies and regulatory frame works assessed in regard to climate change adaptation, disaster risk finance, public financial management, adaptive social protection, rural financing, and agricultural inputs.


Policies to be reviewed include the National Agricultural policy, Natural agricultural financing policy etc.</narrative>
