   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of analytic reports produced and disseminated. (Needs Assessment)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator tracks the number of analytic assessment reports produced and distributed. These reports focus on the needs of Small-Scale Producers (SSPs), categorized by factors such as crop type, gender, farm size, and location. Additionally, the reports highlight risks and opportunities related to products, relevant data sources, and ongoing initiatives aimed at enhancing agricultural productivity and mitigating or adapting to climate risks.</narrative>
    </description>
