     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator tracks the number of local and global partners engaged in the development of agricultural insurance products. the partners will provide infrastructure, coordination, digital solutions and robust, transparent public crop, weather &amp; yield data sets to give insurers and reinsurers more confidence in pricing, and lead to faster product adjustment.</narrative>
